---
source: tools/guinea-profile/tests/reports.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out.stdout).unwrap()"
---
Built-in Perfetto SQL reports
Generate: guinea-profile sql <report> [parameters]
Execute stdout via Perfetto MCP execute_sql or the Perfetto SQL panel.
No file discovery, trace loading, server or source checkout is required to generate SQL.

Common: --pid <OS PID>, --tid <OS TID>, --from 5s --to 20s, --limit 50 (1..10000).
Times are relative to trace start; intervals are [from,to). Default from=0s, to=trace end.
CPU: --automation all|include|exclude selects samples with UIAutomation in any stack frame/module.
This is a stack-name heuristic, not proof that automation caused all work in the interval.

cpu-hotspots: self/inclusive samples per function and module.
cpu-modules: self/inclusive samples per module.
cpu-threads: captured sample counts per process/thread; preserves distinct thread lifetimes.
cpu-compare: inclusive function samples before/after --split 10s; requires --to.
  Shows raw delta_samples and samples/second in each interval (not CPU utilization).
cpu-uiautomation: function samples on UIAutomation stack paths; defaults --automation include.
allocations: exclusive allocated/freed bytes per Guinea operation.
  --group operation (default) or action (nearest action plus causal descendants).
  No recorded action ancestor is a separate group: background or missing ancestry.
  Missing measurement = NULL / not recorded; mixed coverage = partial, never fabricated zero.
  Time/thread filters apply to allocation-owning event starts, not allocation timestamps.
  Action ancestry may cross threads and the selected interval. Freed bytes are measured at event end.

CPU units are captured samples, NEVER CPU milliseconds. Inclusive rows overlap and cannot
be summed across functions/modules. Recursive repeats count once per sample and function.
Names require resolved symbols. Empty CPU results may mean no CPU samples or unmatched filters.
Allocation totals are allocation volume, not retained/live memory. Events without observed
completion may lack counters. Missing ancestry is not proof of background origin.
Stack/causal traversal is bounded to 2048 levels; pid/tid reuse may match multiple lifetimes.
